  "chapter": 431,
  "signer": "ANDREW M. CUOMO",
  "text": "\n                APPROVAL MEMORANDUM - No. 10 Chapter 431\n\n        MEMORANDUM filed with Senate Bill Number 6461, entitled:\n\n    \"AN  ACT  to  amend  the  public authorities law, in relation to the\n        financing  and  construction  of  facilities  by  the  dormitory\n        authority  for Summit Educational Resource, Inc., of Western New\n        York\"\n\n    APPROVED\n\n  This legislation permits the not-for-profit entity \"Summit Educational\nResource, Inc., of Western New York\" to access the construction services\nand tax-exempt financing of the Dormitory Authority of the State of  New\nYork. Because of a technical oversight, this bill incorrectly references\n\"Summit  Educational  Resource,  Inc.,  of Western New York\" and not the\ncorrect entity \"Summit Educational Resources, Inc.\" The Legislature  has\nagreed to pass legislation in the upcoming session to correct this minor\ndrafting error. On that basis, I am signing this bill.\n\n  This bill is approved.                      (signed) ANDREW M. CUOMO\n\n                                ______\n",
  "year": 2016
 },
